<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Amerin cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Amerin cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Monday it had cut Amerin Corp to intermediate-term neutral from intermediate-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The company's rating of long-term accumulate was maintained.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Chicago mortgage insurance company closed on Friday at 21-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
